{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 877349413, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 94, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "高位方向是要T的  <br/>低位方向我是不动的  我说的是我下半年最看好的那个方向。", "lou": 40, "content_length": 67, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785809004}, {"pid": 877349588, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 66, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877349376,47288722,114]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67285134]野比大次郎二号机[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:03):[/b]<br/><br/>可是按昨天买入的点位也只能套利三个点不到，虽然也不错了，底仓跌10个点，T仓3个点[s:ac:抓狂][/quote]<br/>你要这么算的话就不用做股票了  因为怎么算都是亏<br/>上涨的时候 哎呀 今天只T了2个点  如果不T可以倍仓吃10个点  等于亏了8个点。", "lou": 41, "content_length": 115, "reply_to": 877349376, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785809077}, {"pid": 877350068, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 79, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "跟多少点没关系  你们看看刚才的转折点是不是缩转放的那瞬间 然后中继也是那个时候见的高<br/>其他的自然跟随。<br/>但是别的不要怕 这只是高位方向的T点而已<br/>和别的方向不搭嘎。", "lou": 42, "content_length": 151, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785809300}, {"pid": 877350673, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 78, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877350305,47288722,115]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67204929]1one-[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:10):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大看不看植物人那边<br/>八月宇树上市应该会有一波行情吧[/quote]<br/>我只能说  如果给我选 航天和机器人  我选航天。<br/>卫星链仅次于AIDC扩产的确定性。", "lou": 43, "content_length": 75, "reply_to": 877350305, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785809583}, {"pid": 877351767, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 74, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "昨天银行那个诱多真是漂亮。。。。。。<br/>拿转去红利的小登当小X子来整啊。。。。", "lou": 44, "content_length": 73, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785810078}, {"pid": 877352147, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 68, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877351632,47288722,117]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=27036967]滚动的牛奶[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:20):[/b]<br/><br/>不知道经过这一轮，狼大对材料的看法有没有什么变化[/quote]<br/>没有看法  目前走大2浪 不参与  坐等企稳和指数共振走主升大3<br/>那是之后的事情。我才不去硬抗这个大2的ABC  <br/>我又不是SX", "lou": 45, "content_length": 107, "reply_to": 877351632, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785810246}, {"pid": 877352693, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 59, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877352177,47288722,118]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66726390]L林荫[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:24):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，现在如果铁盒到下轨(但不放量跌穿时)，还是继续执行买满吗[/quote]<br/>你这是要吃2次？<br/>我没你那么大的实力  你加油。", "lou": 46, "content_length": 46, "reply_to": 877352177, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785810465}, {"pid": 877352873, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 92, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:29", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877352531,47288722,118]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=19483255]胡子长长[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:26):[/b]<br/><br/>昨天看到狼大说的银行诱多，火速把后面加仓的跑路只留了底仓。机构真是太坏了[s:pst:怨][/quote]<br/>很神奇吧  这种场景在科技里面很常见  但是在银行板块我基本没见过<br/>所以昨天观察到了就这里提了一嘴<br/>我看资金的水平你们是懂的", "lou": 47, "content_length": 117, "reply_to": 877352531, "14": {"13": 3}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785810550}, {"pid": 877353346, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 70, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877352470,47288722,118]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=1333564]jyjunjun[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:26):[/b]<br/><br/>完蛋,刚睡醒!!!!!170没T~![/quote]<br/>刚好 这个时候采访一下你此刻心情<br/>刚好卡这个位置 如果要T  哪怕昨天最低买也就挣一个点  如果不是最低买 基本也就保本  如果不T  是不是怕等下还要继续跌 毕竟出了个尖顶。指数也不太好<br/>内心纠结嘛<br/>老实说噢", "lou": 48, "content_length": 183, "reply_to": 877352470, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785810754}, {"pid": 877353916, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 78, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:36", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我之前是什么时候和你们说上面保3800了？<br/>是不是全市场最先的那批<br/>现在估计大家都发现了[s:ac:哭笑]<br/>一旦资金测试成功  4-4就能走出来了。", "lou": 49, "content_length": 111, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785810993}, {"pid": 877354176, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 83, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877353850,47288722,119]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67157410]c471167449[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:36):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，请教下今天如果早上卖完科技了，什么时候回补呢，尾盘还是明天呢，当前指数也在3800附近了。[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>为什么要卖完科技<br/>一旦3800测试成功 就有4-4<br/>虽然可能硬科技不是最强那个方向 但是总比现在高<br/>所以我一直说 做T套利的仓位是做T套利的  底仓是底仓。<br/>哎<br/>说了也不听 听了也不懂 懂了又装懂。", "lou": 50, "content_length": 170, "reply_to": 877353850, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785811114}, {"pid": 877354472, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 67, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877354035,47288722,120]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid]#anony_ac1e23d9ac5d24b93b12c5a98a35ce8c[/uid][color=gray](2393楼)[/color] (2026-08-04 10:37):[/b]<br/><br/>报告狼大，我早上也没注意高开抛，0.840的本，纠结的要命，0.845一咬牙抛掉了[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>放心 晚一点你就觉得自己卖错了 <br/>但是一旦你操作<br/>你又会觉得自己买回来错了[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 51, "content_length": 69, "reply_to": 877354035, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785811244}, {"pid": 877354711, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 74, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877354199,47288722,120]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=8618693]尼克跑不快[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:38):[/b]<br/><br/>170的T的机会来了吧，缩量(相对于第一次)第二次上冲。[/quote]<br/>哟<br/>不赖啊<br/>谁教你的？", "lou": 52, "content_length": 23, "reply_to": 877354199, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785811341}, {"pid": 877355583, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 141, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:48", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877354890,47288722,122]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=8618693]尼克跑不快[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:43):[/b]<br/><br/>那天不是你心情好说了下做T方法，后面还有狼仔解析实质是分时的顶背离，果断记录小笔记。[s:ac:心][/quote]<br/>奖励你一下  这种第二次冲高半小时如果缩量不过前高 那就果断走，也就是你不要急 可以慢慢等完这个半小时。<br/>在这个半小时内有个绝对不能破的点 就是日均线那条黄线，一旦突发跌破直接走。如果没跌破就找这半小时的高点。", "lou": 53, "content_length": 203, "reply_to": 877354890, "14": {"13": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785811720}, {"pid": 877356083, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 133, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 10:52", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "如果刚才我说的你们看不懂  你们可以拉出中继来观察。<br/>这是真的技术 不是那种路边的如来神掌啊<br/>这是我的精华之一。日常用的最多的技术之一。", "lou": 54, "content_length": 126, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785811939}, {"pid": 877357514, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 55, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 11:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877356906,47288722,124]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=63036990]DDDDD917[/uid] (2026-08-04 10:58):[/b]<br/><br/>报告，中际在9：58-9：59见顶后，始终没跌破黄线，但呈现缩量状态，这个时候保持观察状态，即诱多可能性高。但在次高的几个量柱，量几乎保持一致，理解为有一定支撑，但无法判断是主力还是散户了.......[/quote]<br/>。。。就是横在那里等早上开盘就卖的人追回来<br/>等他们追回来就回落了。", "lou": 55, "content_length": 69, "reply_to": 877356906, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785812547}, {"pid": 877357905, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 26, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 11:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877357655,47288722,125]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=42831256]若星汉满空[/uid] (2026-08-04 11:03):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大狼大，这种银行诱多埋人会持续几天呀？今天早上银行已经跌惨了，但是科技我们也T出去了，如果下午科技还是不看好，对于不敢做大波动的人来说，是不是还是可以回银行？[/quote]<br/>我昨天说了 我不去红利", "lou": 56, "content_length": 25, "reply_to": 877357655, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785812725}, {"pid": 877358758, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 8192, "score": 33, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 11:11", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877358045,47288722,126]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67265639]柚子asd[/uid] (2026-08-04 11:06):[/b]<br/><br/>这么做t是要基于一个大级别的判断就是今天是一个超跌反弹，才生效把？[/quote]<br/>我甚至预判了昨晚美股<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/04/axyfQ44-r9fKlToS81-hi.jpg[/img]", "lou": 57, "content_length": 62, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/04/axyfQ44-r9fKlToS81-hi.jpg", "size": 22, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "image%2epng", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/04", "name": "axyfQ44-r9fKlToS81-hi.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "24", "hash": ""}], "reply_to": 877358045, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785813103}, {"pid": 877360783, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 11:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "笑死了 你们还在那纠结半导体和光那1-2个点的波动的时候<br/>资金都继续去加了低位方向了[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 58, "content_length": 75, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785813997}, {"pid": 877361868, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 30, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 11:35", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877361704,47288722,131]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60925933]ywlight2468[/uid] (2026-08-04 11:34):[/b]<br/><br/>主力总是会出人意料的，前面培养散户十点卖高点的习惯，现在开始甩人下车了，追不追。明天继续高开追不追[/quote]<br/>我不是说么  今天惩罚开盘高开就卖的。", "lou": 59, "content_length": 39, "reply_to": 877361704, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785814516}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 37096, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788251418, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "灼眼的查理", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788251559, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788251328, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/si